<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN"
  "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  SSO-3399: pared back to the minimum entitlements Nexis needs under the
  hardened runtime. The previous file granted:
    * com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory
        - only required for JIT (QML/V8/JSC). Nexis is pure C++/Qt Widgets
          with no JS, QML, or JIT, so dropped.
    * com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation
        - only required for loading dylibs/plugins signed by a different
          TeamID. release.yml re-signs every bundled Qt framework, dylib
          and platform plugin with our Developer ID before signing the app
          bundle, and the app does no runtime dlopen/QLibrary loading.
          Dropped - if a future change requires loading externally-signed
          plugins, restore this entitlement and document why.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
</dict>
</plist>
